          <span class="block">building advisory,</span>
          <span class="block text-[21px] sm:text-2xl lg:text-[28px] 2xl:text-[30px] text-teal-700 font-normal italic mt-1.5 sm:mt-2 lg:whitespace-nowrap">powered by proprietary physics.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-[14.5px] sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-[23.5px] sm:leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-[330px] sm:max-w-none mx-auto sm:mx-0">
          Specialist building science consulting—combining our <span class="whitespace-nowrap">in-house</span> 3D thermal solver, <strong class="text-slate-900 font-medium">native AI optimizer</strong>, and <strong class="text-slate-900 font-medium">automated NBC &amp; ECBC engine</strong> to resolve envelope, HVAC, and CAPEX trade-offs live.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 pt-1 sm:pt-2">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 sm:py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white shadow-md shadow-slate-900/10 transition-all duration-200"
          >
            <span>Discuss a Project</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#engine"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 sm:py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 border border-slate-300 shadow-xs transition-all duration-200"
          >
            <span>Explore Proprietary Stack</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Subtle Practice Highlights -->
        <div class="pt-5 sm:pt-6 border-t border-slate-900/10 grid grid-cols-3 divide-x divide-slate-900/12 sm:divide-x-0 sm:gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
          <div class="px-1 sm:px-0 sm:border-l-2 sm:border-teal-700/35 sm:pl-3 text-center sm:text-left">
            <span class="text-slate-900 block font-semibold text-[11px] sm:text-xs whitespace-nowrap">Native AI</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] block mt-0.5 leading-tight">Pareto search</span>
          </div>
          <div class="px-1 sm:px-0 sm:border-l-2 sm:border-teal-700/35 sm:pl-3 text-center sm:text-left">
            <span class="text-slate-900 block font-semibold text-[11px] sm:text-xs whitespace-nowrap">NBC &amp; ECBC</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] block mt-0.5 leading-tight">Clause checks</span>
          </div>
          <div class="px-1 sm:px-0 sm:border-l-2 sm:border-teal-700/35 sm:pl-3 text-center sm:text-left">
            <span class="text-slate-900 block font-semibold text-[11px] sm:text-xs whitespace-nowrap">EnergyPlus</span>
